* Inverting Amplifier, Av = -10 V/V, ADA4177, +/-15 V supplies
* --------------------------------------------------------------
* Supplies
V1 VP 0 DC 15
V2 VN 0 DC -15

* Input source: 50 mV amplitude, 1 kHz sine (AC 1 for .ac sweep)
Vin IN 0 SINE(0 50m 1k 0 0 0) AC 1

* Gain-setting network:  Av = -R2/R1 = -10 k / 1 k = -10
R1 IN SUMJ 1k
R2 SUMJ OUT 10k

* Op amp: pin order (+IN  -IN  V+  V-  OUT)
XU1 0 SUMJ VP VN OUT ADA4177

* Light load
RL OUT 0 10k

* Genuine ADI model for the ADA4177
.include ADA4177.cir

* Analyses
.tran 0 5m 0 1u
.ac dec 100 1 10Meg

.end
